            "review_title": "Review at Menya Takeichi",
            "review_text": "Cindy\nSingapore9 contributions\n0\nReasonable price Japanese food, take a break from Pho\nJun 2019 • Family\nJust ran into this restaurant when we were out of our wit what and where to have dinner. This shop entrance is very humble. The quality of Japanese ramen really surprised us all!!! Ramen and soup base is super. Skewer of pork belly was so good I reordered the same item. Spicy cod roes stuffed in Sardine was so tasty that I also ordered one more. This was a very nice Japanese ramen place, price is reasonable. I could see a few Japanese Expats having their meal and drink too. Got to be good!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 19, 2019",
